<main class="zd-beta-page">

  <section class="zd-beta-hero">
    <p class="zd-beta-eyebrow">Beta Access</p>

    <h1>Join early and help shape the apps.</h1>

    <p>
      Sign up for early updates, beta testing opportunities, launch news,
      and behind-the-scenes progress for Goal Grower, MyJourney, Blokkr, Kindlitt,
      and future projects.
    </p>

    <div class="zd-beta-actions">
      <a href="#waitlist" class="zd-beta-btn zd-beta-btn--primary">Join Waitlist</a>
      <a href="/pages/projects" class="zd-beta-btn zd-beta-btn--secondary">Explore Projects</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-beta-grid">
    <article>
      <span>01</span>
      <h2>Goal Grower</h2>
      <p>Test goal tracking, visual plant growth, accountability, and shared gardens.</p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <span>02</span>
      <h2>MyJourney</h2>
      <p>Help shape planning, reflection, habits, reviews, and life-direction tools.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="zd-beta-card--dark">
      <span>03</span>
      <h2>Blokkr</h2>
      <p>Test distraction blocking, focus sessions, schedules, and attention reports.</p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <span>04</span>
      <h2>Kindlitt</h2>
      <p>Help shape clean book discovery, reading lists, and recommendation features.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-beta-info">
    <div>
      <p class="zd-beta-eyebrow">What beta testers do</p>
      <h2>Early feedback makes the products better.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="zd-beta-info-list">
      <p>Beta testers may get access to prototypes, app previews, feedback forms, usability tests, and early product updates.</p>
      <p>You do not need to be technical. The most useful feedback is often simple: what felt clear, what felt confusing, and what would make the product more useful.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="waitlist" class="zd-beta-form-section">
    <p class="zd-beta-eyebrow">Join the list</p>
    <h2>Choose the projects you care about.</h2>

    {% form 'customer', class: 'zd-beta-form' %}
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter, beta-waitlist">

      <label for="BetaEmail">Email address</label>
      <input id="BetaEmail" type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="you@example.com" required>

      <label for="BetaProject">Project interest</label>
      <select id="BetaProject" name="contact[project_interest]">
        <option>All projects</option>
        <option>Goal Grower</option>
        <option>MyJourney</option>
        <option>Blokkr</option>
        <option>Kindlitt</option>
        <option>Physical products</option>
      </select>

      <label for="BetaMessage">Why are you interested?</label>
      <textarea id="BetaMessage" name="contact[body]" rows="5" placeholder="Tell me what you want to test or help with."></textarea>

      <button type="submit">Join Beta Waitlist</button>
    {% endform %}
  </section>

</main>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Beta Page",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Beta Page"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}